          "quote": "The Mt Pleasant Radio Observatory is well-located to receive data from this orbit type constantly and for long durations."
        }
      ],
      "reasoning": "The conclusion recaps the main mission segments and notes development risks regarding the Vega E launcher. However, it lacks quantitative synthesis and deeper insight derived from the analysis."
    },
